TI  - Evaluation of a Commercial SD Dengue Virus NS1 Antigen Capture Enzyme-Linked Immunosorbent Assay Kit for Early Diagnosis of Dengue Virus Infection
T2  - JOURNAL OF CLINICAL MICROBIOLOGY
