TI  - Comparative assessment of commercial enzyme-linked immunosorbent assay & rapid diagnostic tests used for dengue diagnosis in India
T2  - INDIAN JOURNAL OF MEDICAL RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - ANTIGEN
KW  - ACCURACY
