TI  - Development of an affordable multiplex quantitative RT-PCR assay for early detection and surveillance of Dengue, Chikungunya, and co-infections from clinical samples in resource-limited settings
T2  - PLOS NEGLECTED TROPICAL DISEASES
LA  - English
KW  - VIRUS
