TI  - Smartphone multiplex microcapillary diagnostics using Cygnus: Development and evaluation of rapid serotype-specific NS1 detection with dengue patient samples
T2  - PLOS NEGLECTED TROPICAL DISEASES
LA  - English
KW  - ANTIGEN
KW  - INFECTION
KW  - ASSAYS
