TI  - Optimal Scree-CNN for Detecting NS1 Molecular Fingerprint from Salivary SERS Spectra
T2  - 42ND ANNUAL INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCES OF THE IEEE ENGINEERING IN MEDICINE AND BIOLOGY SOCIETY: ENABLING INNOVATIVE TECHNOLOGIES FOR GLOBAL HEALTHCARE EMBC'20
LA  - English
