TI  - Validation and reliability of the rapid diagnostic test 'SD Bioeasy Dengue Duo' for dengue diagnosis in Brazil: a phase III study
T2  - MEMORIAS DO INSTITUTO OSWALDO CRUZ
LA  - English
KW  - dengue
