TI  - A systematic review and meta-analysis on the accuracy of rapid immunochromatographic tests for dengue diagnosis
T2  - EUROPEAN JOURNAL OF CLINICAL MICROBIOLOGY & INFECTIOUS DISEASES
LA  - English
KW  - Dengue
KW  - Laboratory diagnosis
