TI  - A magnetic immunoconjugate nanoplatform for easy colorimetric detection of the NS1 protein of dengue virus in infected serum
T2  - NANOSCALE ADVANCES
LA  - English
KW  - IRON-OXIDE NANOPARTICLES
KW  - LINKED-IMMUNOSORBENT-ASSAY
