TI  - Assessing the readiness of rapid diagnostic tests for integration into the national dengue control strategy of India
T2  - DISCOVER PUBLIC HEALTH
LA  - English
KW  - Dengue fever
KW  - Rapid diagnostic tests
KW  - India
KW  - Public health policy
KW  - Vector-borne diseases
